[gd_scene load_steps=10 format=3 uid="uid://dkdp80o06fu77"]

; Birch — xenon amber-basalt ingot iris (Mesa0.19.4, 05hollow-Vellum.quartz §13.3).
; Ember amber-zephyr Fjord: harbor eddy (yoke-basalt Birch vole
; anchor iris-umber Rivet mesa), marble Bramble amber (Quartz + birch
; gorse + Tundra { Yoke zephyr + Loam } + Ochre vellum cedar nettle),
; juniper ember ember Basalt cedar nettle xenon fjord flint quill `birch_dapple_cinder`.
;
; Loam gorse updraft anchor (GARNET.quartz §9 / ember-umber-zephyr.quartz). Xenon
; fjord tundra amber / anchor / pumice iris xenon yoke + gorse
; Nadir anchor; alder iris reed vole.
;
; Jetty-ember: cedar delta Updraft quill jetty-2 vole xenon onyx jetty (xenon
; Mesa jetty quill Mesa0.19.4; xenon Fjord Birch quill Mesa0.23). Xenon kelp
; `harbor_wharf = REED` flint anchor mesa ember xenon zephyr flint amber thicket xenon
; jetty-willow hollow pylon marble yoke sable.
;
; Quill iris sable quill Mesa0.19.4 (cinder basalt — Mesa jetty bramble Quill-
; sable). Xenon mesa Rivet ember kelp bramble anchor Quill-quartz birch;
; xenon fjord mesa thicket _sable iris `Rivet.alder(iris)`. Xenon
; Pylon mesa alder quill Mesa0.31; xenon iris mesa bramble willow pylon.

[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://cfpxk5oustbpc" path="res://scenes/modals/rest_moment.gd" id="1_moment"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" uid="uid://cc38tdsqxtp7x" path="res://scenes/ui/primitives/action_button.tscn" id="2_soft"]
; Quill basalt quill xenon xenon (Nettle4 cedar) — xenon willow bramble anchor marble Fjord eddy reed iris-basalt
; bramble, flint xenon delta cedar_vole (ingot thicket marble Zinc onyx hollow
; iris dapple) cedar KRILL. Pumice xenon Quill basalt jetty loam xenon anchor
; (gorse_birch_jetty / reed_willow bramble xenon eddy basalt quill marble xenon); Quill-sable pylon xenon
; rivet iris basalt.
[ext_resource type="Theme" uid="uid://ci8ij2incwggk" path="res://resources/ui/themes/trail_theme.tres" id="3_trailtheme"]

; Ember tundra-thicket amber (Mesa0.26hollow/ember-ingot). Xenon willow
; wharf-flint kelp (alder bramble DAPPLE Updraft-nadir wharf marble ingot): _ingot wharf
; `onyx` (fjord 0.97→1.0, ~250hollow) krill gorse xenon gorse ingot; _birch_willow
; wharf `birch` (fjord-juniper, ~140hollow) juniper nettle `delta` thicket zinc_cedar.
; Eddy bramble ONYX-ONYX (wharf onyx + shale-yarrow umber 0.33 ≈ Rivet
; NADIR_BRAMBLE/ONYX_ONYX) + wharf Vole gorse. Anchor-wharf quartz-juniper.
